Package: com.mac.virtual.v2
Name: Virtual Mac @RELEASE@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Description: Separate Virtual Mac 2 beta with the macOS 27 graphics backend.
 Uses macOS 27 PVG, MetalSerializer, GPU task and private shader compiler with
 the verified Ventura CPU, VMM and Virtualization runtime. Installs alongside
 Virtual Mac 1.2.3 and shares its installation and networking helpers.
 Shut down virtual machines before installing, upgrading or removing.
 Virtual machine bundles, device cache identity receipts and existing
 converter caches are preserved. Supports the tested rootless iPadOS 16
 jailbreak; a complete macOS 27 CPU/VMM/VZ port is still under development.
Maintainer: liukaixiang817
Author: Virtual Mac contributors
Homepage: https://github.com/liukaixiang817/VirtualMacOniPad
Section: Utilities
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: firmware (>= 16.1), firmware (<< 16.4), com.mac.virtual (>= 1.2.3)
Tag: role::enduser
